  "programme": "A six-lane 400 m track (36.5 m bends, 84.39 m straights, 1.22 m lanes) with an inner kerb, lane lines, stagger starts and a finish line; a grass infield with a 100 x 64 m soccer pitch and goals; a long jump runway and sand pit beside the home straight; a shot put circle and sector in the west D; a concrete walk ringing the track with lights and benches; bleachers, a timber shelter, a hurdle stack and a timber fitness station; prairie shrub beds, flowering cherries and groves of aspen, green ash, bur oak and white spruce.",
  "design_basis": "Original concept after the catalogue running track \"Community Park Track\" references (variant 1). Standard 400 m track geometry as teaching values, not a certified competition facility.",
